  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>center=</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>center</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>center</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>center</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0095_2e37001e5edc.png\" style=\"width: 243px; height: 175px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Then, all the sides are equal of a quadrilateral then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is a square.&nbsp;</p>"
